---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { LEGAL_NAME, ORGANIZATION_NAMES } from '../../../config/organization';

// English legal notice page does not require locale detection.
---

<Layout
  title={`Legal Notice (Specified Commercial Transactions Act) | ${ORGANIZATION_NAMES.en}`}
  description="Legal disclosures required under the Japanese Specified Commercial Transactions Act (SCTA). Includes seller information, payment terms, delivery, and return policies."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="type-heading mb-10 text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">Legal Notice</h1>

    <p class="mb-6 rounded-md border border-primary-900/15 bg-primary-900/[0.03] px-4 py-3 text-sm dark:border-primary-300/15 dark:bg-primary-300/[0.04]">This notice is governed by the laws of Japan. The Japanese version is the authoritative text. This English translation is provided for convenience.</p>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
    <table class="min-w-[42rem] table-auto border-collapse text-left">
      <caption class="sr-only">Seller information required under the Japanese Specified Commercial Transactions Act</caption>
      <tbody class="divide-y divide-primary-200 dark:divide-primary-800">
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Seller</th><td class="py-4">{`${ORGANIZATION_NAMES.en} (${LEGAL_NAME})`}</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Operations Manager</th><td class="py-4">CEO&nbsp;Kousuke&nbsp;Terada</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Address</th><td class="py-4">Tenjin Pine Crest&nbsp;719,<br />2-3-10 Tenjin, Chuo-ku,<br />Fukuoka-shi, Fukuoka 810-0001, Japan</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Phone</th><td class="py-4">+81-70-8561-1659</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Email</th><td class="py-4">company@cor-jp.com</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Sales Price</th><td class="py-4">Services provided on a monthly basis: JPY&nbsp;10,000 per month per service (excluding consumption tax). The service and plan are presented at the time of contract. If a design and development fee applies, its amount and the number of installments are also presented at the time of contract.<br />Other services: We provide individual quotations for each service or project. Quotations are free; please feel free to contact us via our contact page.</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Fees Other Than Product Price</th><td class="py-4">
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
            <li>VAT (consumption tax)</li>
            <li>Bank transfer fees when paying by bank transfer</li>
            <li>Other actual expenses such as server or domain fees, if they arise outside of development, will be clearly stated at the time of quotation.</li>
          </ul>
        </td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Payment Methods</th><td class="py-4">Credit card (Stripe) / Bank transfer<br />Services provided on a monthly basis are paid automatically by credit card every month.</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Payment Timing</th><td class="py-4">Services provided on a monthly basis: Billing closes at the end of each month, and payment is due at the end of the following month. For the first month, we charge one full month regardless of the start date.<br />Other services: In principle, payment is due at the end of the month following the month of delivery (net&nbsp;30). However, an upfront payment may be required or the timing may vary depending on the contract. Details will be specified in the individual contract.</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Delivery / Service Provision</th><td class="py-4">Provided in accordance with the delivery date specified in the individual contract.</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Return / Cancellation Policy</th><td class="py-4">Services provided on a monthly basis: Fees already paid are not refunded. Cancellation conditions are as described under “Subscription Cancellation”.<br />Other services: Due to the nature of the services, we generally do not accept cancellations or refunds after production has started. Conditions for contract termination will be stipulated in the individual contract.</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Handling of Defects</th><td class="py-4">If a serious defect that differs from the contract is found in the delivered product, we will correct it free of charge within 3&nbsp;months after delivery.</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Quantity Limitations</th><td class="py-4">None</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">System Requirements</th><td class="py-4">Delivered websites / web applications are guaranteed to work on the latest versions of the following browsers: Google&nbsp;Chrome, Safari, Firefox, Microsoft&nbsp;Edge.</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Subscription Cancellation</th><td class="py-4">The minimum contract period for services provided on a monthly basis is 1&nbsp;year from the contract date. After that, the contract renews automatically every month unless you request cancellation. Please request cancellation by email (company@cor-jp.com). The service ends on the same day one month after the day we accept your request (or on the last day of that month if it has no such day). For example, if we accept your request on November&nbsp;5, the service ends on December&nbsp;5. The fee for the month that includes the end date is prorated by day up to the end date and billed at that month's month-end closing. If the end date is less than 1&nbsp;year after the contract date, we bill the fees for the remaining period (the fees for the rest of the period until 1&nbsp;year from the contract date) and the remaining installments of the design and development fee in a single payment at the month-end closing of the month that includes the end date. Fees already paid are not refunded. Details will be specified in the individual contract.</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Special Sales Conditions</th><td class="py-4">Not applicable</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="py-4 pr-6 align-top font-medium">Secondhand Dealer License</th><td class="py-4">Not applicable</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
